  "description": "-> Boost -> your in-game performance as MUCH as POSSIBLE and play with all extras from OptiFine! Huge diffrence! -> 26.3 is now available ✔",
  "body": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_header.gif\" alt=\"\" /></strong></p> \n<p><strong>⚠️ Requires&nbsp;Modrinth&nbsp;App &raquo;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/app\">Playing Modpacks | Modrinth App</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Light Craft |&nbsp;The best&nbsp;FPS Boost&nbsp;Pack by MoonPlay Team</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Increase your&nbsp;FPS in-game&nbsp;(more FPS than OptiFine</strong><strong>) a</strong><strong>nd add useful extras!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Latest Version &raquo; 26.3 - 9.1.1 (Recommended)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Don't you need&nbsp;OptiFine&nbsp;add-ons for&nbsp;LightCraft?&nbsp;Do you only care about&nbsp;a basic FPS Boost? You can download the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/lightcraftprojectlite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Light Craft&nbsp;Lite</strong></a>!</strong></p>\n<p>Do you want to set up your own&nbsp;server? Try our&nbsp;<strong>Server Pack&nbsp;</strong>(available on CurseForge or Bisect Hosting)&nbsp;Fabric Server&nbsp;optimized as much as possible.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/2gQGYw3qfF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-2C2F33?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://moonplay-team.gitbook.io/light-craft/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Wiki-2C2F33?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=bookstack&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"78\" height=\"28\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/lightcraftprojectlite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Lite%20version-2C2F33?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=quora&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"139\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_installation.webp\" alt=\"\"/></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fe6bINQgNtQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/How_to_Install-Watch_on_YouTube-red?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube\" alt=\"Generated button\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/lightcraftproject\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge%20Download-CLICK-orange?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"\" /></strong></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_description.webp\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><!-- x-tinymce/html --></p>\n<p><strong>Why should you choose&nbsp;Light Craft instead of OptiFine and other modpacks?</strong></p>\n<p>&raquo; That modpack is <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">much faster</span> than OptiFine 📈</p>\n<p>&raquo; <!-- x-tinymce/html -->Support for capes (including OptiFine capes), which you can also get for<strong>&nbsp;FREE</strong>!</p>\n<p>&raquo; <!-- x-tinymce/html --> All major features from OptiFine such as <strong>Shaders</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Zoom</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Dynamic Lights,</strong><strong> Resource Packs, </strong>etc. are included in this Modpack.</p>\n<p>&raquo; Bug Fixes 🐞</p>\n<p>&raquo; Weekly Updates</p>\n<p>&raquo; You can play using a Controller 🎮</p>\n<p>&raquo; You can add mods by yourself (for ex.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/plugin/simple-voice-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">in game voice chat</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/xaeros-world-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">map</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/essential\" target=\"_blank\">essential&nbsp;</a>etc.)</p>\n<p>&raquo; Clean UI</p>\n<p>&raquo;&nbsp;<strong>Huge FPS Boost!</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" /></strong></p>\n<div>\n<p>NVIDIA RTX 2060 - Intel Core I5 10400F - SEED: \"test\" - 2 chunks - (Test date: 13.05.2025)</p>\n<p><strong>⚠️</strong>Please remember that the results may vary for each individual depending on drivers version, the graphics card brand and its version, the installed operating system, processor, etc.<strong>⚠️</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.minecraft.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla</a>&nbsp;&raquo;&nbsp;</strong>984 FPS</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fblogger.googleusercontent.com%2Fimg%2Fa%2FAVvXsEiB4FMjWS6Vm8inn9r8oSeglW3sGKFiyhvWyfiAZ03Yl1MazWJaLY6_6MMu2kpWngbFA55watIBOcQ5S1qy_X-6o_9jMq256KcZP9c9cdle8gZ3hXy54QOmQbGOaUWmcIgovdTkb3hCVvkHx_Tm_44ZrbE1B9ZSq3sG4H-plXaCRAChBz2xSgQrLdKz1uSv&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"806\" height=\"453\" /></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://optifine.net/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Optifine (HD_U_J3)</a>&nbsp;&raquo;&nbsp;</strong>1008 FPS</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgmtdEO_nKU-AijkaoA_3ItKROAETnqxEshgz8Ica8Ud875g3AFu2OHPMCKA0OOGDMg-UUA47GzpOaMHxJgHhl461lP0Io_MzpGwHFigzAUAFpv2R5S3e6PeABhhXJeMGvpl1lfO8HJgM_41T2qFnohfS1oHhRXacUjYxLTSWzCCzPKnfzoIG9_D4dodX-E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.forgecdn.net%2Fattachments%2Fdescription%2F537750%2Fdescription_8ff9ef86-e49a-431e-b75b-fbaabd032fd3.webp&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"\" /></strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fabulously-optimized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Fabously Optimized (9.0.0-beta.1)</a>&nbsp;&raquo;&nbsp;</strong>697 FPS (Probably a bug in the modpack?)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.forgecdn.net%2Fattachments%2Fdescription%2F537750%2Fdescription_4984bc8c-5ea0-4b81-a634-565c5f944567.webp&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<br />\n<p><strong>Light Craft (6.1.0) &raquo;&nbsp;</strong>1702 FPS&nbsp;<strong>&lt;- WINNER</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.forgecdn.net%2Fattachments%2Fdescription%2F537750%2Fdescription_6b14c740-6567-42b1-a0a6-9487ad020c3b.webp&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\" /></strong></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_faq.webp\" alt=\"\"  /></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Q: Why does Light Craft disable features like Dynamic Lights, Particles, Better Grass by default?</strong><br />A: To maximize FPS. You can enable them anytime in the settings.</p>\n<p><strong>Q: Do I need OptiFine?</strong><br />A: No! Light Craft is powered by a modern Fabric/Sodium base &ndash; no OptiFine needed.</p>\n<p><strong>Q: Can I add other mods?</strong><br />A: Yes. Light Craft is compatible with most popular utility mods.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>| Minimum Server RAM: 2GB | Recommended Server RAM: 4GB | Minimum Allocated RAM: 2GB+ |</strong></p>\n<a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/MPTeamHosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_promo.gif\" alt=\"\"  /></a></p>\n<h2>Enjoy Minecraft to the fullest by hosting your game server with BisectHosting. Not only do they offer servers in 20 different locations worldwide, but their decade of expertise guarantees an exceptional gaming experience. Their automated modpack installer and updater makes setting up and maintaining your server a breeze. Plus, their 24/7 support is always there to help you with any inquiries. Use promo code FPS and get 25% off your first month as a new customer!</h2>",
